@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@jobId = replace-with-job-id

### Liveness

GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness

GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Create a texture generation job

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/textures/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "weathered red brick wall",
  "resolution": 512,
  "seed": 12345
}

### Get job status

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/textures/jobs/{{jobId}}

### Download Albedo

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/textures/jobs/{{jobId}}/image/albedo

### Download Normal map

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/textures/jobs/{{jobId}}/image/normal

### Download Height map

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/textures/jobs/{{jobId}}/image/height

### Download Roughness map

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/textures/jobs/{{jobId}}/image/roughness

### Download Ambient Occlusion

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/textures/jobs/{{jobId}}/image/ao